            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electric work vehicle 1 includes a rear housing 12, a motor 18,20 for driving a rear wheel 4R,4L through a gearing 19,21 and a Power Take-Off (PTO) motor to drive a PTO output shaft 502. The motor 18,20 for driving the rear wheel 4R,4L and the PTO motor 22 are supported by the rear housing 12. An axis of the motor 18,20 for driving a rear wheel 4R,4L is located above the PTO output shaft 502 in an up-down direction of the electric work vehicle 1.</p>
            </abstract>
